 "brief": "Gaza Municipality warned that severe shortages of spare parts, oils, tires, batteries, and hydraulic system supplies have forced several of its vehicles and equipment out of service, Shehab Wire reported. The municipality said the deficits are limiting its capacity to maintain essential operations as winter approaches.\n\nThe shortage affects municipal machinery needed for sanitation, infrastructure repair, and other public services during the colder months when demand typically increases.",
